00:08:25.004 --> 00:08:26.670
to switch between
different parts of it.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:29.420
So click on the hamburger
button, go find the thing.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:32.450
So we will take a
look at Compute Engine

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:36.840
and come over here and
create an instance.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:42.500
So we can give it a
name like "awesome."

